#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:93
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:95
msgid ""
"PyBaMM optionally collects anonymous usage data to help improve the library. "
"This telemetry is opt-in and can be easily disabled. Here's what you need to "
"know:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:97
msgid ""
"**What is collected**: Basic usage information like PyBaMM version, Python "
"version, and which functions are run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:98
msgid ""
"**Why**: To understand how PyBaMM is used and prioritize development efforts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:99
msgid ""
"**Opt-out**: To disable telemetry, set the environment variable "
"`PYBAMM_DISABLE_TELEMETRY=true` (or any value other than `false`) or use "
"`pybamm.telemetry.disable()` in your code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/index.md:100
msgid ""
"**Privacy**: No personal information (name, email, etc) or sensitive "
"information (parameter values, simulation results, etc) is ever collected."
msgstr ""
